<title>UK: CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SEMIFINAL DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY SEMIFINAL DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the semifinals of the NatWest Trophy made on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Essex v Glamorgan (to be played August 12)</p>
<p>Warwickshire v Sussex (August 13)</p>
